### 1. Health Check (GET) - Safe to open in Browser
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

###

### 2. Register a New Student (POST - requires JSON body)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shraviya@placement.edu",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "Shraviya",
  "lastName": "Poojary",
  "role": "ROLE_STUDENT"
}

###

### 3. Login with Credentials (POST - requires JSON body)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shraviya@placement.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 4. Get Current User Profile (GET - requires Bearer token)
# Replace <YOUR_TOKEN> with the token from the register/login response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_TOKEN>
